{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“先接下眼下能承担的那份”保留了承担行动，“心里仍没把握，却找回一点力气和骄傲”也表达了疑虑未消而行动带来力量的心理变化，没有新增外部事件或具体场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“那种曾经亲近的生活”把珠子中泛指的珍惜之物和旧歌式记忆具体化为他曾经亲近过的一种生活，补出了原文没有确定的前史对象；失落仍在则有珠子依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“他反复告诉自己没事，起初还信几分，后来连这句话也压不住他的在意”把 B4 中“像反复对自己说‘我没事’”的比喻落实成了他真的在进行自我对话，并把比喻中的过程写成确定事实；末句对不安反扑的概括本身没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S01-4说明他反复试图稳住自己却被牵挂拉回，能解释他仍然犹疑，却没有直接给出他终于决定承担一份责任的推动力。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"不愿垮下去提供了行动动机，而害怕投入后失去珍惜之物又限制了行动范围，能够解释他为什么先承担眼下能承担的那份。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他先决定承担、随后发现牵挂和失落仍在、最后连自我安抚也难以维持的递进，不依赖珠子也能理解基本心理过程。\",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-3\",\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“不甘心就此垮下去”几乎重复了 S01-3 的“不愿就此垮下去”；S02-1 已经写出他开始承担责任以及由此找回力量和骄傲，这一动机复述可以删去，以突出本段真正新增的变化。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fef67506-8d8a-49e4-965c-41c2be21f07b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T051555059850Z", "elapsed_seconds": 201.593, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:19:16.647414+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9d40d6a815681550789370d208359b1d4e32986fd7048eccde4dfe343e89076f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T051555059850Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "85ff550573f2572fd8523d97fcb49da41e010a09a40c70824e5d5e644d79b635"}}}
